'''Lasvoss''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 9.0 Update|Version 9.0]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during [[THE DYNAMITES (Gacha Event)|THE DYNAMITES]] and [[WAVE BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|WAVE BUSTERS]] events. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 10.4 Update|Version 10.4]] improves health, attack power, [[Strengthen]] activation threshold, and is immune to [[Immune to Toxic|Toxic]] & [[Immune to Surge|Surges]]. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 12.6 Update|Version 12.6]].

